  "description": "VUCXAV crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C144 H168 Dy9 N16 O42 1-,H3 O1 1+,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 10 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy9 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.614-5.127 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.10-172.38°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C144H183Dy9N16O49. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ5-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
